========================================
Blue-Green Deployment - Day 55
Date: $(date +'%a %b %d %H:%M:%S %Z %Y')
========================================

What was built:
  Blue app  (v1): Node.js app returning version=v1, environment=blue
  Green app (v2): Node.js app returning version=v2, environment=green
  Nginx router  : switches traffic between blue and green via config reload

Switch mechanism:
  docker cp nginx/nginx-<target>.conf nginx-router:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf
  docker exec nginx-router nginx -s reload
  Zero downtime - no container restart needed

Tests performed:
  Blue active   : curl localhost -> v1 blue confirmed
  Switch green  : curl localhost -> v2 green confirmed
  Rollback blue : curl localhost -> v1 blue confirmed

Files Created:
  scripts/blue-green/app-blue/app.js
  scripts/blue-green/app-blue/Dockerfile
  scripts/blue-green/app-green/app.js
  scripts/blue-green/app-green/Dockerfile
  scripts/blue-green/nginx/nginx-blue.conf
  scripts/blue-green/nginx/nginx-green.conf
  scripts/blue-green/docker-compose.yml
  scripts/blue-green/switch.sh

Cost: $0 - all local Docker, no AWS resources used

Day 55 complete - Blue-green deployment with Docker
